TY  - JOUR
ID  - arxiv-0804.0917v1
AU  - Yuqun Chen, Yongshan Chen
AU  - Zhong, Chanyan
TI  - Composition-Diamond Lemma for Modules ∗
DA  - D:20210715
UR  - https://arxiv.org/abs/0804.0917
AB  - In this paper we give some relationships among the Gr¨obner-Shirshov bases in free associative algebras, free left modules and “double-free” left modules (free modules over a free algebra). We give the Chibrikov’s Composition-Diamond lemma for modules and show that Kang-Lee’s Composition-Diamond lemma follows from this lemma. As applications, we also deal with highest weight module over the Lie algebra sl2, Verma module over a Kac-Moody algebra, Verma module over Lie algebra of coeﬃcients of a free conformal algebra and the universal enveloping module for a Sabinin algebra.
ER  - 
